  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Every stem is a short kid sentence that needs one object pronoun at the end. Never put the answer inside the stem.",
      "Exactly one choice can complete the stem. Drop any choice that still makes a true other-person reading.",
      "The main distractor is the personal or reflexive twin of the right word. The other two are wrong person, number, or case.",
      "Never use <NAME> as the subject of himself or herself. The name list has no gender.",
      "Keep about half reflexive and half personal. Use home, school, food, pets, play, family, or weather only.",
      "Do not write metalanguage, brands, real names, or picture descriptions in stems or choices."
    ]
  },
